{"id":"n66248-2-8","stage":1,"title":"바쁘다 · 匆忙","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66248-2-8-1","ko":"아침부터 바쁘게 움직였는데도 물건을 많이 못 팔았네.","zh":"从早上开始就忙个不停，可还是没卖出去多少东西啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바쁘게","meaning":"匆忙，急忙","explanation":"바쁘다：匆忙，急忙；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"2","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"움직였는데도","meaning":"动，移动，动弹","explanation":"움직이다：动，移动，动弹；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"움직이다","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58166","senseId":"1","lemma":"움직이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔았네.","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"匆忙，急忙","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"非常急。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"05377c221a1ec676","term":"움직이다","zh":"动，移动，动弹","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3","entryId":"58166","definition":"变换位置或姿势；或指使位置或姿势发生变化。","pronunciation":["움지기다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5cb3a75e78d176e705d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66248-2-8-2","ko":"남은 건 내일 다시 팔자.","zh":"剩下的明天再试着卖掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남은","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔자.","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，再次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"反复相同的话或行动。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0f4454d029b60f11cb6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66248","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4255,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从早上开始就忙个不停，可还是没卖出去多少东西啊。","剩下的明天再试着卖掉吧。","我可以试穿这条牛仔裤吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从早上开始就忙个不停，可还是没卖出去多少东西啊。","剩下的明天再试着卖掉吧。","我可以试穿这条牛仔裤吗？"],"answer":1}]}
